cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "BlackBox: Autonomous Data Incident Response on DataHub"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-gated autonomous agent for data-incident response: it reads
  DataHub's context graph, proves a root cause against a machine-enforced
  evidence gate, repairs the pipeline, verifies the fix against the full
  invariant suite, and writes the resolution back into DataHub.
